Package: linux-nvidia-6.17-headers-6.17.0-1012
Build-Profiles: <!stage1>
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, coreutils
Description: Header files related to Linux kernel version 6.17.0
 This package provides kernel header files for version 6.17.0, for sites
 that want the latest kernel headers. Please read
 /usr/share/doc/linux-nvidia-6.17-headers-6.17.0-1012/debian.README.gz for details

Package: linux-nvidia-6.17-tools-6.17.0-1012
Build-Profiles: <!stage1>
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, linux-tools-common
Description: Linux kernel version specific tools for version 6.17.0-1012
 This package provides the architecture dependant parts for kernel
 version locked tools (such as perf and x86_energy_perf_policy) for
 version 6.17.0-1012.
 You probably want to install linux-tools-6.17.0-1012-<flavour>.

Package: linux-nvidia-6.17-cloud-tools-6.17.0-1012
Build-Profiles: <!stage1>
Architecture: amd64
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, linux-cloud-tools-common
Description: Linux kernel version specific cloud tools for version 6.17.0-1012
 This package provides the architecture dependant parts for kernel
 version locked tools for cloud tools for version 6.17.0-1012.
 You probably want to install linux-cloud-tools-6.17.0-1012-<flavour>.

Package: linux-image-unsigned-6.17.0-1012-nvidia
Build-Profiles: <!stage1>
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Provides: linux-image, fuse-module, kvm-api-4, redhat-cluster-modules, ivtv-modules, virtualbox-guest-modules [amd64], ${linux:rprovides}
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, kmod, linux-base (>= 4.5ubuntu1~16.04.1), linux-modules-6.17.0-1012-nvidia
Recommends: grub-pc [amd64] | grub-efi-amd64 [amd64] | grub-efi-ia32 [amd64] | grub [amd64] | lilo [amd64] | flash-kernel [arm64] | grub-efi-arm64 [arm64], initramfs-tools | linux-initramfs-tool
Breaks: flash-kernel (<< 3.90ubuntu2) [arm64 armhf], s390-tools (<< 2.3.0-0ubuntu3) [s390x]
Conflicts: linux-image-6.17.0-1012-nvidia
Suggests: bpftool, linux-perf, linux-nvidia-6.17-tools, linux-headers-6.17.0-1012-nvidia
Description: Linux kernel image for version 6.17.0
 This package contains the unsigned Linux kernel image for version 6.17.0.
 .
 Supports NVIDIA processors.
 .
 Intended for NVIDIA platforms
 .
 You likely do not want to install this package directly. Instead, install
 the linux-nvidia meta-package, which will ensure that upgrades work
 correctly, and that supporting packages are also installed.

Package: linux-image-unsigned-6.17.0-1012-nvidia-dbgsym
Build-Profiles: <!stage1>
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: linux-debug
Description: Linux kernel debug image for version 6.17.0
 This package provides the unsigned kernel debug image for version 6.17.0.
 .
 This is for sites that wish to debug the kernel.
 .
 The kernel image contained in this package is NOT meant to boot from. It
 is uncompressed, and unstripped. This package also includes the
 unstripped modules.


Package: linux-modules-6.17.0-1012-nvidia
Build-Profiles: <!stage1>
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, wireless-regdb
Built-Using: ${linux:BuiltUsing}
Description: Linux kernel modules for version 6.17.0
 Contains the corresponding System.map file, the modules built by the
 packager, and scripts that try to ensure that the system is not left in an
 unbootable state after an update.
 .
 Supports NVIDIA processors.
 .
 Intended for NVIDIA platforms
 .
 You likely do not want to install this package directly. Instead, install
 the linux-nvidia meta-package, which will ensure that upgrades work
 correctly, and that supporting packages are also installed.

