Package: linux-modules-nvidia-fs-6.17.0-1012-nvidia
Build-Profiles: <!stage1>
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Provides: ${nvidia-fs:rprovides}
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 linux-image-6.17.0-1012-nvidia | linux-image-unsigned-6.17.0-1012-nvidia,
Built-Using: ${linux:BuiltUsing}
Description: Linux kernel nvidia-fs modules for version 6.17.0-1012
 This package provides the Linux kernel nvidia-fs modules for version
 6.17.0-1012.
 .
 You likely do not want to install this package directly. Instead, install the
 one of the linux-modules-nvidia-fs-nvidia* meta-packages,
 which will ensure that upgrades work correctly, and that supporting packages are
 also installed.

